Please clone the oneDPL and oneTBB GitHub repositories in the current directory before building the SYCL program

https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDPL
https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneTBB

The offset-based oneapi::dpl::experimental::reduce_by_segment is used when
ONEDPL_HAS_SEGMENTED_ALGORITHMS >= 202611L (a recent oneDPL, see
https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDPL/issues/2829). With an older oneDPL,
only the custom SYCL kernel is built and run. The oneDPL algorithm is also
skipped with AdaptiveCpp, where it returns wrong results for more than 2048
segments (https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDPL/issues/2924).
